{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10358290","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10358290","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1035829001:0":{"text":"전 이곳의 무시무시한 악마의 균열을 지켜보고 있어요.","source_cn":"我被安排在这里盯着这可怕的恶魔裂隙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C4D7BB8E11514F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035829002:0":{"text":"만약 몬스터가 악마의 균열에서 뛰쳐나온다면...","source_cn":"万一有什么魔物从裂隙里跑了出来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B69011645B7BE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1035829002":{"text":"만약 몬스터가 악마의 균열에서 뛰쳐나온다면...","source_cn":"万一有什么魔物从裂隙里跑了出来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57B69011645B7BE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035829003:0":{"text":"아니요, 전 종을 울려 주변 사람들에게 경고하고, 성기사들이 저를 구하러 올 때까지 기다리는 일을 맡았어요.","source_cn":"我就负责摇铃警告周围的人，然后等待圣骑士们过来救我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F699E60BFF652D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1035829004:0":{"text":"휴, 어째서 더 강한 사람을 보내지 않는 건지...","source_cn":"唉，为什么不能直接派个厉害的人来看守裂隙呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7692C381EA38233","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_